      "content": "Don't worry, it's not uncommon for toddlers to sleep more when they're feeling under the weather. That being said, the diarrhea and lack of wet diapers are a bit concerning. I'd recommend giving your little one some diluted apple juice, but make sure to mix it with water, not just apple juice itself, and give him a full glass every hour. Also, I'd like to see a pediatrician for a check-up, just to make sure everything is okay.",
